    <div class="" style="text-align:justify;padding-top:50px;font-size:22px;">

        <div class="container-fluid">
            <div class="col-md-3"></div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <h1 class="bold" style="text-align:center;">Contact Us</h1>
                <p>
                    Thank you for your interest in Human Relief Mission(HRM). If you have any questions, feedback, or would like to learn more about our organization and the work we do, please don't hesitate to contact us. You can reach us through the contact form below or visit our office at the address provided. We appreciate your support and look forward to connecting with you.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Human Relief Mission is committed to making a meaningful impact in the lives of individuals and communities in need. Your partnership and generosity are vital in helping us achieve our mission of providing humanitarian aid and support to those facing challenges and hardships. Thank you for considering HRM and for being a part of our journey towards creating a more compassionate and equitable world.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3"></div>
        </div>

    </div>

